('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','WHAT CHANGED? The new Kia Seltos is hybrid only, from $39,990 drive away. That is about $6,700 more than the petrol Seltos it replaces, but still under the Toyota Corolla Cross and Hyundai Kona hybrids it is aimed at. Every grade runs a 1.6 litre petrol hybrid and the top GT-Line e-AWD is $55,490 drive away. It reaches showrooms this month. Would you pay the extra for the hybrid? Full story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/new-kia-seltos-hybrid-only-from-39990-drive-away-2026-10-03',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/mon-05-oct-am-kia-seltos-hybrid.jpg'],'2026-10-04T22:00:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-05-am-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','image','WHAT CHANGED? The new Kia Seltos is hybrid only, from $39,990 drive away. That is about $6,700 more than the petrol Seltos it replaces, and it undercuts the Toyota Corolla Cross and Hyundai Kona hybrids it is aimed at. Every grade runs a 1.6 litre petrol hybrid, and the top GT-Line e-AWD is $55,490 drive away. It reaches showrooms this month. Would you pay the extra for the hybrid? Link in bio for the full story. #cartell #kiaseltos #hybrid #newcars #australia',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/mon-05-oct-am-kia-seltos-hybrid.jpg'],'2026-10-04T22:02:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-05-am-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','ONE THING YOU NEED TO KNOW. Toyota has widened its Kluger recall to 46,467 vehicles built from 2021 to mid 2025, across GX, GXL and Grande in petrol, all wheel drive and hybrid. A second row seatback recliner may not fully engage, so the seat back could move in a crash or hard braking. The fix is free. Do not wait for the letter: call the Toyota recall line on 1800 987 366 or ring your dealer with your VIN. Tag a Kluger owner. Full story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/toyota-kluger-recall-expands-to-46467-check-your-vin-2026-10-03',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/mon-05-oct-pm-toyota-kluger-recall.jpg'],'2026-10-05T07:30:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-05-pm-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','image','ONE THING YOU NEED TO KNOW. Toyota has widened its Kluger recall to 46,467 vehicles built from 2021 to mid 2025, across GX, GXL and Grande in petrol, all wheel drive and hybrid. A second row seatback recliner may not fully engage, so the seat back could move in a crash or hard braking. The fix is free. Do not wait for the letter: call the Toyota recall line on 1800 987 366 or ring your dealer with your VIN. Send this to anyone who drives a Kluger. Link in bio. #cartell #recall #toyotakluger #carsafety #australia',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/mon-05-oct-pm-toyota-kluger-recall.jpg'],'2026-10-05T07:32:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-05-pm-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','WHAT $45K GETS YOU. The cheapest family hybrid SUV right now? Honda ZR-V e:HEV X, $43,400 drive away. Toyota RAV4 GX Hybrid 2WD is $45,990 before on-road costs, so it lands higher once you add them, and it went on sale without an ANCAP rating. Subaru Forester Hybrid AWD is $46,990 drive away until 31 October. Get every quote on the same basis before you compare. Which one is on your shortlist? Honda: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/honda-zr-v-hybrid-from-43400-driveaway-undercuts-tucson-sportage-forester-2026-09-09',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/tue-06-oct-am-family-hybrid-prices-slide-1.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/tue-06-oct-am-family-hybrid-prices-slide-2.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/tue-06-oct-am-family-hybrid-prices-slide-3.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/tue-06-oct-am-family-hybrid-prices-slide-4.jpg'],'2026-10-05T22:00:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-06-am-fb','roxy',null),
