('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','PRICE JUST DROPPED. The Tesla Model Y Performance now starts at $84,900 before on-road costs, down $4,500 from $89,400, because Tesla has moved its build to Shanghai. The catch: premium paint is now an optional extra, up to $2,600, so the real saving is smaller if you want a colour. Every new Model 3 and Model Y also gets Power Share, Tesla''s name for vehicle to load. Would you take the cheaper Performance, or step down a grade? Full story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/tesla-model-y-performance-australia-84900-cheaper-shanghai-2026-10-02',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/tue-06-oct-pm-tesla-model-y-performance.jpg'],'2026-10-06T07:30:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-06-pm-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','image','PRICE JUST DROPPED. The Tesla Model Y Performance now starts at $84,900 before on-road costs, down $4,500 from $89,400, because Tesla has moved its build to Shanghai. The catch: premium paint is now an optional extra, up to $2,600, so the real saving is smaller if you want a colour. Every new Model 3 and Model Y also gets Power Share, Tesla''s name for vehicle to load. Would you take the cheaper Performance, or step down a grade? Link in bio. #cartell #tesla #modely #ev #pricedrop',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/tue-06-oct-pm-tesla-model-y-performance.jpg'],'2026-10-06T07:32:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-06-pm-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','NEW BRAND DECODER. Who is Jaecoo? It is a sub brand of Chinese carmaker Chery, sold in Australia alongside its sister brand Omoda. The line-up runs J5 (the smallest SUV), J7 (mid size) and J8 above it. The J7 plug-in hybrid uses an 18.4kWh lithium iron phosphate battery with a claimed 100km of electric range on the front drive version, and it is backed by an eight year warranty. Which Chinese brand do you want decoded next? J7 details: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/jaecoo-j7-my27-gains-awd-plug-in-hybrid-flagship-from-39990-2026-09-04',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/wed-07-oct-am-who-is-jaecoo.jpg'],'2026-10-06T22:00:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-07-am-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','image','NEW BRAND DECODER. Who is Jaecoo? It is a sub brand of Chinese carmaker Chery, sold in Australia alongside its sister brand Omoda. The line-up runs J5 (the smallest SUV), J7 (mid size) and J8 above it. The J7 plug-in hybrid uses an 18.4kWh lithium iron phosphate battery with a claimed 100km of electric range on the front drive version, and it is backed by an eight year warranty. Which Chinese brand do you want decoded next? Link in bio. #cartell #jaecoo #chery #newcars #australia',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/wed-07-oct-am-who-is-jaecoo.jpg'],'2026-10-06T22:02:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-07-am-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','UTE STARTING PRICES. Three ways into a new dual use ute, all before on-road costs. Toyota HiLux WorkMate $33,990, up $6,260, with the new range due in December. Isuzu D-Max from $36,200, now automatic only with a new 2.2 litre diesel. Ford Ranger XL Cab-Chassis $37,130, unchanged, with the wet belt bi-turbo replaced by a single turbo diesel with a timing chain. Add on-roads before you compare any drive away deal. Which ute is yours? HiLux story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/2026-toyota-hilux-workmate-now-from-33990-up-from-27730-2026-09-14',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/wed-07-oct-pm-ute-starting-prices-slide-1.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/wed-07-oct-pm-ute-starting-prices-slide-2.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/wed-07-oct-pm-ute-starting-prices-slide-3.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/wed-07-oct-pm-ute-starting-prices-slide-4.jpg'],'2026-10-07T07:30:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-07-pm-fb','roxy',null),
