('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','ONE THING YOU NEED TO KNOW. Hyundai has recalled 14,551 Kona SUVs built in the 2025 and 2026 model years, petrol, hybrid and electric. Certain rear centre seat belt buckle anchors did not meet specification, so that belt may not work as intended in a crash. Until replacement parts arrive, Hyundai says do not use the rear centre seat. The repair is free and owners will be contacted in writing. Check your VIN at vehiclerecalls.gov.au or call Hyundai on 1800 186 306. Tag a Kona owner. Full story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/hyundai-recalls-14551-kona-suvs-rear-seatbelt-fault-check-your-vin-2026-09-30',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/thu-08-oct-am-hyundai-kona-recall.jpg'],'2026-10-07T22:00:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-08-am-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','image','ONE THING YOU NEED TO KNOW. Hyundai has recalled 14,551 Kona SUVs built in the 2025 and 2026 model years, petrol, hybrid and electric. Certain rear centre seat belt buckle anchors did not meet specification, so that belt may not work as intended in a crash. Until replacement parts arrive, Hyundai says do not use the rear centre seat. The repair is free and owners will be contacted in writing. Check your VIN at vehiclerecalls.gov.au or call Hyundai on 1800 186 306. Send this to a Kona owner. Link in bio. #cartell #recall #hyundaikona #carsafety #australia',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/thu-08-oct-am-hyundai-kona-recall.jpg'],'2026-10-07T22:02:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-08-am-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','reel','NEW AND UNDER $40K. Two ways to spend it. The Mahindra XUV700 AX7 is $29,990 drive away, the cheapest new seven seater in Australia, but it is 2025 build stock and the deal ends 31 October. The all new LDV T60 is $39,990 drive away for private buyers ($37,990 on an ABN), with a 163kW 2.5 litre diesel, 520Nm and an eight speed auto, on sale this month. Seven seats or a ute: which one would you take? T60 story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/2027-ldv-t60-arrives-from-39990-drive-away-bigger-diesel-2026-10-01',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/thu-08-oct-pm-under-40k-reel.mp4'],'2026-10-08T07:30:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-08-pm-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','reel','NEW AND UNDER $40K. Two ways to spend it. The Mahindra XUV700 AX7 is $29,990 drive away, the cheapest new seven seater in Australia, but it is 2025 build stock and the deal ends 31 October. The all new LDV T60 is $39,990 drive away for private buyers, with a 163kW 2.5 litre diesel, 520Nm and an eight speed auto, on sale this month. Seven seats or a ute: which one would you take? Link in bio. #cartell #newcars #ldvt60 #mahindra #australia',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/thu-08-oct-pm-under-40k-reel.mp4'],'2026-10-08T07:32:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-08-pm-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','PRICE JUST DROPPED. The 2027 Audi Q6 e-tron now opens at $89,900 before on-road costs, in both SUV and Sportback body styles. That is $9,918 less than the $99,818 it replaces. The SQ6 e-tron SUV falls $21,418 to $129,900 plus on-roads, and the SQ6 Sportback starts at $134,900. Production starts in October and the first Australian deliveries are due in the first half of 2027. The lower price also brings the Q6 under the EV incentive and luxury car tax thresholds. Would you pay $89,900 for it? Full story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/audi-q6-e-tron-cut-to-89990-sq6-drops-21418-australia-2026-09-15',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/fri-09-oct-am-audi-q6-e-tron-price-cut.jpg'],'2026-10-08T22:00:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-09-am-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','image','PRICE JUST DROPPED. The 2027 Audi Q6 e-tron now opens at $89,900 before on-road costs, in both SUV and Sportback body styles. That is $9,918 less than the $99,818 it replaces. The SQ6 e-tron SUV falls $21,418 to $129,900 plus on-roads, and the SQ6 Sportback starts at $134,900. Production starts in October and the first Australian deliveries are due in the first half of 2027. The lower price also brings the Q6 under the EV incentive and luxury car tax thresholds. Would you pay $89,900 for it? Link in bio. #cartell #audi #q6etron #evaustralia #newcarprices',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/fri-09-oct-am-audi-q6-e-tron-price-cut.jpg'],'2026-10-08T22:02:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-09-am-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','WAIT OR BUY NOW? Three cars, three answers. The facelifted 2027 Lexus NX goes hybrid only with an ES style cabin, and Australian pricing is still to come, so it is worth waiting. The next Honda CR-V is reportedly due globally in February 2027, but there is no Australian timing and the current CR-V stays on sale, so watch rather than wait. The BYD Atto 1 Essential is $19,990 drive away until 15 December, then $23,990 before on-roads from 1 January, so buy now if you want one. Which are you doing? Atto 1 story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/byd-atto-1-stays-19990-drive-away-until-15-december-2026-09-29',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/fri-09-oct-pm-wait-or-buy-slide-1.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/fri-09-oct-pm-wait-or-buy-slide-2.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/fri-09-oct-pm-wait-or-buy-slide-3.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/fri-09-oct-pm-wait-or-buy-slide-4.jpg'],'2026-10-09T07:30:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-09-pm-fb','roxy',null),
