('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','reel','CARNIVAL OR CX-90? Two big family answers. The Kia Carnival seats eight and starts at $54,560 plus on-roads for the S Diesel, with the S Hybrid from $56,310 and a claimed 5.8L/100km. The Mazda CX-90 seats seven or eight and starts at $66,100 plus on-roads, with a 3.3 litre inline six in petrol (254kW) or diesel (187kW) form and rear biased AWD. Which one is your school run? Prices and specs: https://www.cartell.tv/cars/kia/carnival and https://www.cartell.tv/cars/mazda/cx-90',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/sat-10-oct-pm-big-family-reel.mp4'],'2026-10-10T07:30:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-10-pm-fb','roxy',null),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','reel','CARNIVAL OR CX-90? Two big family answers. The Kia Carnival seats eight and starts at $54,560 plus on-roads for the S Diesel, with the S Hybrid from $56,310 and a claimed 5.8L/100km. The Mazda CX-90 seats seven or eight and starts at $66,100 plus on-roads, with a 3.3 litre inline six in petrol (254kW) or diesel (187kW) form and rear biased AWD. Which one is your school run? Link in bio. #cartell #kiacarnival #mazdacx90 #familycar #australia',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/sat-10-oct-pm-big-family-reel.mp4'],'2026-10-10T07:32:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-10-pm-ig','roxy',null),
('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','CARS YOU FORGOT WERE STILL SOLD. The Honda Accord is one hybrid grade at $64,900 drive away, with 152kW and a claimed 4.3L/100km. The Mazda CX-3 has been here since 2015 and starts at $30,670 plus on-roads, 2.0 litre petrol only. The Mazda MX-5 starts at $42,640 plus on-roads, with a 135kW naturally aspirated 2.0 litre and a six speed manual. Check the safety rating date before you sign. Which one would you buy? Prices: https://www.cartell.tv/cars/mazda/mx-5',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/sun-11-oct-am-cars-still-sold-slide-1.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/sun-11-oct-am-cars-still-sold-slide-2.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/sun-11-oct-am-cars-still-sold-slide-3.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/sun-11-oct-am-cars-still-sold-slide-4.jpg'],'2026-10-10T22:00:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-11-am-fb','roxy',null),
