('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image','DRIVE AWAY DEAL, ENDS 31 OCTOBER. The Subaru Crosstrek AWD 2.0L is $38,990 drive away, a fixed national price with on-road costs already included. The same campaign has the Impreza AWD 2.0L from $36,490 drive away, the Forester AWD at $44,990 and the Forester Hybrid at $46,990. It is a limited offer that closes on 31 October 2026. Would you take the Crosstrek or step up to the Forester? Full story: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/subaru-national-drive-away-forester-44990-ends-31-october-2026-09-24',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/cartell/sun-11-oct-pm-subaru-crosstrek-drive-away.jpg'],'2026-10-04T07:30:00+00','queued','w1005-cartell-2026-10-11-pm-fb','roxy',null),
