('32a573bb-697e-4c12-b64a-290a5991bbfc','image','Most gravel bikes stop at 45mm. We checked the Gravel Finder: of 26 gravel bikes sold in Australia with a listed tyre clearance, 16 top out at 45mm.

The spread: 16 at 45mm, 1 at 47mm, 5 at 50mm and 4 at 53mm. The widest are the Giant Revolt and the Liv Devote. That is the field the new 57mm Canyon Grail is walking into.

Spec trap: Giant''s 53mm only applies in the long flip chip position. Short setting, less tyre.

Method: BikeFinder Gravel Finder, max tyre clearance field, 26 of 34 gravel bikes with a listed value, checked 4 Oct 2026. Researched from manufacturer and retailer sources, not physical tests.

