('32a573bb-697e-4c12-b64a-290a5991bbfc','image','3,625m of climbing. 140.7km. One day. That is the elite men''s course at the UCI Gravel World Championships in Nannup, Western Australia, on Sunday 11 October. The women race 123.1km and 3,100m on Saturday.

Swipe for what the course asks of the bike:
