('7a1b5eff-3026-4988-b5fd-5e42c8489b1c','image','$140 buys 0.5kg and a 1x drivetrain. The Merida Silex 400 is $2,499 and the Silex 700 is $2,639 in BikeFinder''s Gravel Finder.

