('32a573bb-697e-4c12-b64a-290a5991bbfc','image','$140 buys 0.5kg and a 1x drivetrain. That is the gap between the Merida Silex 400 ($2,499) and the Merida Silex 700 ($2,639) in our Gravel Finder.

