('ace75e80-c5ea-41f9-a568-867d9baddf1a','image','Sea views and a slow roll. Cairns Esplanade, QLD.

Up to 4 km return, about an hour, mostly flat. A sealed off road cycle route that starts at the Lagoon precinct. Ride out to 2 km, turn, and save the rest of the evening for a sit by the water.

It is shared with walkers, so keep the pace easy. Check Cairns Regional Council notices before you go.

Still on the King''s Birthday long weekend? This is the low effort win. What is your go to slow roll?

