('ace75e80-c5ea-41f9-a568-867d9baddf1a','image','A little of the Fernleigh Track. Newcastle, NSW.

Up to 6 km return, 1.5 to 2 hours allowed, on a sealed shared track with gentle rail trail grades. Join at Dibbs Street and Brisbane Water Road in Adamstown, follow the signs towards Belmont, and turn by 3 km. That is a taster of the 15 km Adamstown to Belmont trail, not an official named route.

It is also a commuter route: keep left, use lights if you ride through the tunnel, and walk the road crossings. Check City of Newcastle trail notices before you go.

Which rail trail should we cover next?

Full guide with the map and stops: https://ridefinder.au/rides/nsw/fernleigh-track-adamstown/

