('ace75e80-c5ea-41f9-a568-867d9baddf1a','image','What to pack for 20 km. Four things, no fuss.

1. Water and snacks: start with full bottles, carry more when it is hot, and add a snack and sunscreen.
2. The flat kit: a spare tube or patch kit, tyre levers and a small pump. Practise one tube change at home.
3. Phone and light: save the local map offline, and carry a rear light if you may finish near dusk.
4. Helmet and brakes: fit the helmet, check the brakes and tyres, then go.

What is the one thing you never leave home without?

Find an outing that suits your first long ride: https://ridefinder.au/rides/

Images are AI generated for illustration.

