('ace75e80-c5ea-41f9-a568-867d9baddf1a','image','Ride of the week: Busselton foreshore and play, WA.

Up to 6 km return, 1.5 to 2 hours allowed, on a mostly flat sealed dual use path along the bay. Start near the jetty, ride west, turn by 3 km, and save the playground for when you are back. The jetty itself is not part of the cycling route, so park the bikes before you walk out.

Watch for beach access points, dogs on leads and people crossing between lawns and sand. A tailwind out can mean a harder ride home, so turn early. Check City of Busselton notices before you go.

Who are you taking this weekend?

Full guide with maps and stops: https://ridefinder.au/rides/wa/busselton-foreshore-outing/

