('ace75e80-c5ea-41f9-a568-867d9baddf1a','image','3 km to the shops. What are you taking?

Could you do this trip without the car? On a flat route with no stops, 3 km is about 10 to 12 minutes by bike, 7 to 9 minutes by e-bike and 9 to 12 minutes by scooter. A pannier or a backpack handles the shopping.

The maths: bike 15 to 18 km/h, e-bike 20 to 25 km/h (the assist stops at 25 km/h), scooter 15 to 20 km/h and under your state limit. Hills and crossings add time.

What was the last 3 km trip you drove? Pick a ride at ridefinder.au, a bike at bikefinder.au, an e-bike at ebikefinder.au or a scooter at scootfinder.au.

Image is AI generated for illustration.

