('ace75e80-c5ea-41f9-a568-867d9baddf1a','image','A short coastal roll in Darwin. Nightcliff foreshore, NT.

Up to 4 km return, up to an hour, on a sealed shared path with gentle coastal grades. Start by Nightcliff Jetty, ride up to 2 km along the foreshore towards the pool and Rapid Creek, then roll back for a jetty view or a picnic. The jetty itself is not part of the cycling route.

Sunset draws a crowd, so allow time to finish riding before dark. Follow the crocodile and marine hazard warnings and keep the rest stop on land. Check City of Darwin notices before you go.

Where is your favourite jetty to ride to?

Full guide with maps and stops: https://ridefinder.au/rides/nt/nightcliff-foreshore/

Photo: DaHuzyBru, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.

