('87db4aca-36a7-4fb1-a590-9e2a143fb42a','image','Payload: the number buyers skip.

Take a van''s ATM (the most it can weigh loaded) and subtract its tare (the weight as built). What is left is what you can add: water, gas, food, gear.

Five real vans, published model figures:
Retreat Whitsunday 217C, from $116,930: 573 kg
Snowy River SRC-17, from $64,990: 536 kg
Ezytrail Parkes 15 Lounge, from $61,191: 550 kg
Retreat Macquarie 186C, from $108,540: 1,018 kg
Crusader Chameleon Liberty SV, from $69,204: 1,189 kg

Options and fitted extras change the tare, so check the compliance plate on the exact van you inspect.

Which of these surprised you most? Send this to someone who is shopping for a van.

Compare similar caravans: https://caravanscout.au/compare

