('162784a0-7283-4ea7-a878-6dba86e08d70','image','Prams for two, side by side. Bugaboo Donkey 6 Double: 19.04 kg, folds to 56 x 79.5 x 90 cm, $2,549 RRP (bundle with two seats and bassinet). Thule Urban Glide 3 Double: 16 kg, 88 x 79 x 34 cm, $1,799.95 RRP. Baby Jogger city mini GT2 Double: 16 kg, 81.5 x 77.5 x 34 cm, $1,399 RRP. Doubles are bigger and heavier, so measure your boot first. RRP checked 25 to 28 September 2026. Link in bio to compare. Send this to a parent expecting number two. #pramkin #doublepram #growingfamily #ausparents',array['https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/pramkin/2026-10-10-am-prams-for-two-1.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/pramkin/2026-10-10-am-prams-for-two-2.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/pramkin/2026-10-10-am-prams-for-two-3.jpg','https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media@6d84380/posts/2026-10-05/pramkin/2026-10-10-am-prams-for-two-4.jpg'],'2026-10-09T22:02:00+00','queued','w1005-pramkin-2026-10-10-am-ig','roxy',null),
