('e98d115c-09ce-4c5f-bf24-4c5d3df31147','image','"Have you dined with us before?"

Yes? No? Either way: "Wonderful. Let me explain the concept."

Dishes arrive as they are ready (dessert may beat the starter). We recommend three to four plates each (you will order eleven, then ask for bread).

